ace cuz again we've  got plenty of religiously motivated  characters with layers and with death to  them like lady Melisandre like the  brothers without banners that having her  be this sort of almost Spanish  Inquisition kind of character just it  feels like a cop-out and it's so  simplified that it feels like it doesn't  belong in this universe of much deeper  much more layered characters I mean the  great things about the characters in  these show is that they've got many  motivations oftentimes conflicting you  know they've got their interest in power  but maybe they're conflicted because  they also want to protect their family  and maybe those are in conflict with  someone like Daenerys you have her  desire for conquest and revenge but at  the same time wishing to be a good and  noble ruler and those are coming into  conflict and to have someone who's just  so no it's this this is what I'm all  about  and that's it and just it it just is  such a ill fit for this world and for  all these deep characters that I just  wish she wasn't even there so there you  have it I love this show but these are  what I feel are the 10 worst characters  so who do you think is the worst  character on Game of Thrones I don't  care how big of a fan of this show you  are there's at least one out there that  you go I really don't like you and not  in that fun love to hate them Joffrey  Baratheon wait like you genuinely wish  they just weren't on the show whoever it  is drop something down in the comments  and let's talk about it until next time  this council is adjourned

